    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Misaki Tetsumora is a well renowned judge who resides in the supernatural town of Kazemori. Where criminals of all kinds run amok.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humans, ghosts, thieves, serial killers, zombies, speeding ticket violators and demonic jerks to name a few. It's your job to help her choose the final verdict on each one of the criminals that come into her courtroom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But, be careful. Each choice comes with a different moral alignment.\u00a0The judge is sexy, the criminals are nasty and the jury is just a talking skeleton who loves handing out guilty verdicts like candy on Halloween.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By the end of the day, what kind of judge will you become?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time will tell in &quot;The Judge&quot;. The final verdict is...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Warning: This game may contain content that some viewers may find disturbing, offensive and cruel. Such as humiliation, verbal mention of sexual assault and death, etc.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Misaki Tetsumora is a well renowned judge who resides in the supernatural town of Kazemori. Where criminals of all kinds run amok.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humans, ghosts, thieves, serial killers, zombies, speeding ticket violators and demonic jerks to name a few. It's your job to help her choose the final verdict on each one of the criminals that come into her courtroom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But, be careful. Each choice comes with a different moral alignment.\u00a0The judge is sexy, the criminals are nasty and the jury is just a talking skeleton who loves handing out guilty verdicts like candy on Halloween.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By the end of the day, what kind of judge will you become?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time will tell in &quot;The Judge&quot;. The final verdict is...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Warning: This game may contain content that some viewers may find disturbing, offensive and cruel. Such as humiliation, verbal mention of sexual assault and death, etc.</p>",
    "short_description": "Take down multiple criminals case by case as you judge each and every one of them. Will you be naughty or nice? The final verdict is up to you!",
